  "decisions": {
    "variant": "MuSiQue-Ans only. MuSiQue-Full is not run pooled: in full_dev_pooling_leak, all 2,417 unanswerable dev questions get their withheld supporting paragraph back through the answerable twin's context. Full would need per-question corpora (20 paragraphs each); deferred.",
    "confirmatory_split": "ans dev (2,417 questions, 21,100 unique paragraphs). Test labels are hidden (labelled 0), so test is never used.",
    "tuning_split": "a fixed, hop-stratified slice of ans train drawn only from questions none of whose paragraphs appear in the dev pool (17.5% of dev paragraphs also occur in train), with its own pooled corpus. Size, seed and ids are recorded by the phase B converter; the comparison family is frozen on it before any dev run.",
    "paragraph_ids": "musique-<sha256(title + '\\n' + text)[:16]>, identical paragraphs deduped into one document. 0 collisions across every split.",
    "full_split_duplicate_ids": "Full splits repeat each question id twice by design: the answerable question and its unanswerable contrast copy."
  },
